  "guide_title": "Guide",
  "@guide_title": {
    "description": "A title for a guide"
  },
  "guide_share_label": "分享",
  "guide_nutriscore_v2_title": "The Nutri-Score is evolving: explanations!",
  "@guide_nutriscore_v2_title": {
    "description": "The title of the guide (please don't forget the use of non-breaking spaces)"
  },
  "guide_nutriscore_v2_what_is_nutriscore_title": "What is the Nutri-Score?",
  "guide_nutriscore_v2_what_is_nutriscore_paragraph1": "The Nutri-Score is a logo which aims to inform you about the **nutritional quality of foods**.",
  "@guide_nutriscore_v2_what_is_nutriscore_paragraph1": {
    "description": "Text between asterisks (eg: **My Text**) means text in bold. Please try to keep it."
  },
  "guide_nutriscore_v2_what_is_nutriscore_paragraph2": "The colour code varies from dark green (**A**) for the **healthiest** products to dark red (**E**) for the **less healthy** ones.",
  "@guide_nutriscore_v2_what_is_nutriscore_paragraph2": {
    "description": "Text between asterisks (eg: **My Text**) means text in bold. Please try to keep it."
  },
  "guide_nutriscore_v2_nutriscore_a_caption": "The Nutri-Score A logo",
  "guide_nutriscore_v2_why_v2_title": "Why is Nutri-Score evolving?",
  "guide_nutriscore_v2_why_v2_intro": "The Nutri-Score formula **is evolving** to provide better recommendations:",
  "guide_nutriscore_v2_why_v2_arg1_title": "Better evaluate all drinks",
  "guide_nutriscore_v2_why_v2_arg1_text": "The comparative notes of **milk**, **dairy drinks** with added sugar and **vegetable** drinks were better differentiated in the new algorithm.",
  "guide_nutriscore_v2_why_v2_arg2_title": "Better ranking of drinks",
  "guide_nutriscore_v2_why_v2_arg2_text": "The **sugar content** is better taken into account and favors **lowly sweetened** drinks.\\n**Sweeteners will also be penalised**: diet sodas will be downgraded from a B rating to between C and E. Water remains the recommended drink.",
  "guide_nutriscore_v2_why_v2_arg3_title": "Salt and sugar penalised",
  "guide_nutriscore_v2_why_v2_arg3_text": "Products **too sweet** or **too salty** will see their **rating further downgraded**.",
  "guide_nutriscore_v2_why_v2_arg4_title": "Hierarchy within oils and fishes",
  "guide_nutriscore_v2_why_v2_arg4_text": "The rating of certain **fatty fish** and **oils rich in good fats** will improve.",
  "guide_nutriscore_v2_why_v2_arg5_title": "Limit red meat",
  "guide_nutriscore_v2_why_v2_arg5_text": "Consumption of **red meat should be limited**. This is why **poultry will be comparatively better ranked**.",
  "guide_nutriscore_v2_new_logo_title": "How to differentiate old Nutri-Score and new calculation?",
  "guide_nutriscore_v2_new_logo_text": "From now on, the logo can display a mention \"**New calculation**\" to clarify that this is indeed the new calculation.",
  "guide_nutriscore_v2_new_logo_image_caption": "The logo of the new Nutri-Score",
  "guide_nutriscore_v2_where_title": "在哪裡可以找到新的營養評分計算方法？",
  "guide_nutriscore_v2_where_paragraph1": "Nutri-Score 已在 7 個國家應用：法國、德國、比利時、西班牙、盧森堡、荷蘭和瑞士。",
  "guide_nutriscore_v2_where_paragraph2": "製造商最遲有**2年**的時間，從法令簽署之日起**將**舊的計算方法替換為新的計算方法。",
  "guide_nutriscore_v2_where_paragraph3": "Without waiting, you **will already find in the OpenFoodFacts application**, the new calculation, including if the manufacturers have not updated the score.",
  "guide_nutriscore_v2_unchanged_title": "What doesn't change",
  "guide_nutriscore_v2_unchanged_paragraph1": "The Nutri-Score is a score designed to **measure nutritional quality**. It is **complementary to the NOVA group** on **ultra-processed foods** (also present in the application).",
  "guide_nutriscore_v2_unchanged_paragraph2": "For manufacturers, the display of the Nutri-Score **remains optional**.",
  "guide_greenscore_title": "Green-Score",
  "@guide_greenscore_title": {
    "description": "The title of the guide (please don't forget the use of non-breaking spaces)"
  },
  "guide_greenscore_what_is_greenscore_title": "什麼是綠色分數？",
  "guide_greenscore_what_is_greenscore_paragraph1": "Green-Score 是一個標誌，旨在告知您**食品對環境的影響**。",
  "@guide_greenscore_what_is_greenscore_paragraph1": {
    "description": "Text between asterisks (eg: **My Text**) means text in bold. Please try to keep it."
  },
  "guide_greenscore_what_is_greenscore_paragraph2": "The colour code varies from dark green (**A+**) for the **least impactful** products to dark red (**F**) for the **most impactful** products.",
  "@guide_greenscore_what_is_greenscore_paragraph2": {
    "description": "Text between asterisks (eg: **My Text**) means text in bold. Please try to keep it."
  },
  "guide_greenscore_logos_caption": "Green-Score 標誌",
  "guide_greenscore_lca_title": "核心：生命週期評估（LCA）",
  "guide_greenscore_lca_arg1_title": "食品類別的科學評估",
  "guide_greenscore_lca_arg1_text1": "對於每個產品類別，使用來自 Agribalyse 環境資料庫（由 ADEME 和 INRAE 設計）的資料建立一個**基準**分數。",
  "guide_greenscore_lca_arg1_text2": "**生命週期分析**是一種進行多階段、多標準環境評估的標準化評估方法。",
  "guide_greenscore_lca_arg1_text3": "**其測量：**",
  "guide_greenscore_lca_arg2_title": "6個生產步驟",
  "guide_greenscore_lca_arg2_agriculture": "農業",
  "guide_greenscore_lca_arg2_processing": "處理中",
  "guide_greenscore_lca_arg2_packaging": "包裝套件",
  "guide_greenscore_lca_arg2_transportation": "Transportation",
  "guide_greenscore_lca_arg2_distribution": "Distribution",
  "guide_greenscore_lca_arg2_consumption": "Consumption",
  "guide_greenscore_lca_arg3_title": "14項環境影響指標",
  "guide_greenscore_lca_arg3_text1": "氣候變遷/碳足跡",
  "guide_greenscore_lca_arg3_text2": "臭氧層損耗",
  "guide_greenscore_lca_arg3_text3": "電離輻射",
  "guide_greenscore_lca_arg3_text4": "土地",
  "guide_greenscore_lca_arg3_text5": "水和能源的使用",
  "guide_greenscore_lca_arg3_text6": "空氣污染",
  "guide_greenscore_lca_arg3_text7": "海水和淡水（顆粒、酸化、富營養化）",
  "guide_greenscore_lca_arg3_text8": "資源枯竭。",
  "guide_greenscore_bonuses_penalties_title": "獎金和罰款",
  "guide_greenscore_bonuses_penalties_intro": "為了獎勵某一類別中較優秀的產品，我們會根據若干標準應用**獎金和懲罰**：",
  "guide_greenscore_bonuses_penalties_arg1_title": "Mode of production",
  "guide_greenscore_bonuses_penalties_arg1_text": "帶有**官方標籤、保證環境效益的標籤或認證**（有機、公平貿易、HVE、Label Rouge、Bleu Blanc Cœur、MSC/ASC）的產品將獲得**獎勵**。",
  "guide_greenscore_bonuses_penalties_arg2_title": "配料來源",
  "guide_greenscore_bonuses_penalties_arg2_text": "依原料產地，會給予**額外獎金**。此獎金會考慮**運輸對產品的影響**以及各生產商所在國家的**環境政策**。",
  "guide_greenscore_bonuses_penalties_arg3_title": "Endangered species",
  "guide_greenscore_bonuses_penalties_arg3_text": "含有對生物多樣性和生態系統造成重大負面影響的成分的產品，例如棕櫚油，將會受到**處罰**，因為棕櫚油的生產是造成大規模森林砍伐的原因。",
  "guide_greenscore_bonuses_penalties_arg4_title": "包裝套件",
  "guide_greenscore_bonuses_penalties_arg4_text": "計算**罰款**時，會考慮**包裝的**循環性**（使用回收原材料和可回收性）和過度包裝。",
  "guide_greenscore_transparency_title": "An increased need for transparency to better measure and reduce environmental impacts",
  "guide_greenscore_transparency_intro1": "要準確計算綠色評分，需要一些**包裝上不一定標明的信息**（例如每種成分的來源和確切百分比），或者一些很少以可用形式提供的信息（例如包裝所有組件的清單以及所用塑料的確切類型）。",
  "guide_greenscore_transparency_intro2": "**當這些資訊尚不可用時，將使用平均值**，但我們現在呼籲大家幫助我們收集這些信息，這些信息對於綠色評分以及許多其他用途都將非常有用。",
  "guide_greenscore_transparency_arg1_title": "公民可以如何提供協助？",
  "guide_greenscore_transparency_arg1_text": "所有公民都可以幫助我們收集和整理產品上存在的信息或可以從產品中推斷出的信息，例如包裝信息：“包裝任務”：一項針對所有食品包裝的大規模合作清點計劃（法語）。",
  "guide_greenscore_transparency_arg2_title": "製造商如何提供協助",
  "guide_greenscore_transparency_arg2_text": "製造商可以透過我們為生產商提供的免費平台直接向我們發送他們的資訊。",
  "guide_greenscore_better_product_title": "哪種產品對地球比較好？",
  "guide_greenscore_better_product_arg1_title": "很難說",
  "guide_greenscore_better_product_arg1_text": "選擇永續食品是我們為氣候所能做的最強大的事情之一，因為**我們的全球食品系統造成了超過四分之一的溫室氣體排放**。\n（資料來源：Poore & Nemecek，Science，2018）。",
  "guide_greenscore_better_product_arg2_title": "你有力量！",
  "guide_greenscore_better_product_arg2_text": "好消息是，這為我們提供了一種強而有力的變革方法。\n**我們每個人每年大約吃1000餐**。這意味著我們有1000個機會**為地球選擇更美好的未來**！",
  "guide_greenscore_better_product_arg3_title": "幫助承擔責任並做出決定",
  "guide_greenscore_better_product_arg3_text": "選擇永續食品可能感覺很複雜。標籤令人困惑，資訊也常常缺少。 Green-Score 的創建旨在簡化這一過程，為您提供**清晰**、**基於科學**且**透明**的食品環境評級，就在您需要的時候：購物時。",
  "guide_greenscore_better_product_arg4_title": "透明度",
  "guide_greenscore_better_product_arg4_text": "與專有標籤不同，Green-Score 計算**完全開放**，並且**任何人都可以驗證**。",
  "guide_nova_title": "Group 4. Ultra-processed foods",
  "@guide_nova_title": {
    "description": "The title of the guide (please don't forget the use of non-breaking spaces)"
  },
  "guide_nova_what_is_nova_title": "什麼是超加工？",
  "guide_nova_what_is_nova_paragraph1": "NOVA 小組會向您介紹**食品加工程度**。",
  "@guide_nova_what_is_nova_paragraph1": {
    "description": "Text between asterisks (eg: **My Text**) means text in bold. Please try to keep it."
  },
  "guide_nova_what_is_nova_paragraph2": "The NOVA classification allows for the categorisation of foods into **4 groups** based on their **degree of industrial processing** (minimally processed or unprocessed foods, culinary ingredients, processed foods, ultra-processed foods).",
  "@guide_nova_what_is_nova_paragraph2": {
    "description": "Text between asterisks (eg: **My Text**) means text in bold. Please try to keep it."
  },
  "guide_nova_logos_caption": "NOVA 標誌",
  "guide_nova_groups_title": "4個NOVA組",
  "guide_nova_groups_intro": "NOVA 有 4 組，有問題的是第 4 組 - 超加工食品。",
  "guide_nova_groups_arg1_title": "低度加工或未加工食品",
  "guide_nova_groups_arg1_text": "未加工（或天然）食品是指從自然界分離出來的**植物的可食用部分**（種子、果實、葉子、莖、根）**或**動物的**可食用部分**（肌肉、內臟、蛋、奶），以及真菌、藻類和水。",
  "guide_nova_groups_arg2_title": "Group 2. Processed culinary ingredients",
  "guide_nova_groups_arg2_text": "加工烹飪原料，如**油、奶油、糖和鹽**，是從第 1 類食品或自然界通過壓榨、精煉、研磨、碾磨和乾燥等工藝獲得的物質。",
  "guide_nova_groups_arg3_title": "Group 3. Processed foods",
  "guide_nova_groups_arg3_text": "加工食品，例如瓶裝蔬菜、罐裝魚、糖水水果、起司和新鮮麵包，**主要是透過在第一類食品中添加鹽、油、糖或其他第二類物質**製成的。加工過程包括各種保鮮或烹飪方法，麵包和起司的加工過程還包括非酒精發酵。大多數加工食品含有兩到三種成分，可以識別為第一類食品的改良版本。它們可以單獨食用，但更常見的是與其他食物搭配食用。",
  "guide_nova_groups_arg4_title": "Group 4. Ultra-processed foods",
  "guide_nova_groups_arg4_text": "超加工食品，如軟性飲料、甜味或鹹味包裝零食、重組肉製品和預製冷凍食品，**不僅僅是改良食品，而是主要或完全由食品衍生物質和添加劑製成的配方**，幾乎不含或完全不含第一類完整食物。這些配方中的成分通常包括加工食品中常見的成分，例如糖、油、脂肪或鹽。然而，超加工產品也含有其他一些通常不用於烹飪的能量和營養來源。其中一些直接提取自食物，例如酪蛋白、乳糖、乳清和麩質。",
  "guide_nova_explanations_title": "超加工的問題",
  "guide_nova_explanations_arg1_title": "食品原料的極端加工",
  "guide_nova_explanations_arg1_text": "許多成分**源自於食品成分的進一步加工**，例如氫化油或酯交換油、水解蛋白質、大豆分離蛋白、麥芽糊精、轉化糖和高果糖玉米糖漿。",
  "guide_nova_explanations_arg2_title": "超越純淨食品安全的添加物",
  "guide_nova_explanations_arg2_text": "Additives in ultra-processed foods include some that are also used in processed foods, such as preservatives, antioxidants, and stabilisers. Classes of additives found only in ultra-processed products include those used **to imitate or enhance the sensory qualities of foods or to disguise unpalatable aspects of the final product**. These additives include dyes and other colours, colour stabilisers; flavors, flavor enhancers, non-sugar sweeteners; and processing aids such as carbonating, firming, bulking and anti-bulking agents, de-foaming, anti-caking and glazing agents, emulsifiers, sequestrants, and humectants.",
  "guide_nova_explanations_arg3_title": "在家無法完成的處理",
  "guide_nova_explanations_arg3_text": "為了將通常種類繁多的原料混合並製成最終產品（因此稱為“超加工”），需要運用**多種加工工序**。這些工序包括一些**國內沒有類似製程**，例如氫化和水解、擠壓和成型以及油炸前的預處理。",
  "guide_nova_explanations_arg4_title": "超加工的掠奪性和財務面",
  "guide_nova_explanations_arg4_text": "超加工的總體目標是打造品牌化、便利（耐儲存、即食）、誘人（口感極佳）且利潤豐厚（原料成本低）的食品，旨在取代所有其他食品類別。超加工食品通常包裝精美，並進行密集行銷。",
  "guide_nova_explanations_arg5_title": "對健康有害",
  "guide_nova_explanations_arg5_text": "Since 2018, with NutriNet-Santé, the first links between **the consumption of ultra-processed foods and increased risks of cancer, cardiovascular diseases, and diabetes have been highlighted**. Today, more than 90 studies worldwide confirm these findings.\nThe strongest associations relate to **obesity, cardiovascular mortality, and depressive symptoms**. On children, the effects are primarily observed on weight and lipid imbalances.",
  "guide_nova_explanations_arg6_title": "各國建議限制它們",
  "guide_nova_explanations_arg6_text": "一些國家在其飲食指南或目標中使用了 NOVA 分組，例如：\n\n- **🇧🇷 巴西**的飲食指南**建議限制加工食品的攝取量**，並避免食用超加工食品。\n\n- **🇫🇷 法國**2018-2022 年公共衛生營養政策目標旨在**將第 4 組超加工食品的攝取量減少 20%**。",
  "guide_nova_share_link": "https://world.openfoodfacts.org/nova",
  "@guide_nova_share_link": {
    "comment": "Make sure the link exists before adding a translation"
  },
  "guide_open_food_facts_title": "歡迎來到開放食品真相！",
