  "guide_open_food_facts_what_is_open_food_facts_title": "什麼是開放食品資訊？",
  "guide_open_food_facts_what_is_open_food_facts_paragraph1": "Open Food Facts 是一個**協作式**、**免費**、**開放**的全球食品資料庫。",
  "@guide_open_food_facts_what_is_open_food_facts_paragraph1": {
    "description": "Text between asterisks (eg: **My Text**) means text in bold. Please try to keep it."
  },
  "guide_open_food_facts_what_is_open_food_facts_paragraph2": "我們相信每個人都應該有權利了解自己所吃的食物資訊。透過收集成分、過敏原、營養成分等數據，**我們幫助消費者做出明智的選擇**，並推動食品業**走向更高的透明度**。",
  "@guide_open_food_facts_what_is_open_food_facts_paragraph2": {
    "description": "Text between asterisks (eg: **My Text**) means text in bold. Please try to keep it."
  },
