  "guide_open_pet_food_facts_what_is_open_pet_food_facts_title": "什麼是「公開寵物食品真相」？",
  "guide_open_pet_food_facts_what_is_open_pet_food_facts_paragraph1": "Open Pet Food Facts 將我們的使命擴展到了毛茸茸的朋友們！這是一個**貓、狗和其他伴侶動物的寵物食品產品資料庫**。",
  "@guide_open_pet_food_facts_what_is_open_pet_food_facts_paragraph1": {
    "description": "Text between asterisks (eg: **My Text**) means text in bold. Please try to keep it."
  },
  "guide_open_pet_food_facts_what_is_open_pet_food_facts_paragraph2": "我們收集有關**成分**、**營養分析**和餵食指南的信息，以幫助寵物主人選擇最適合其寵物需求的食物。",
  "@guide_open_pet_food_facts_what_is_open_pet_food_facts_paragraph2": {
    "description": "Text between asterisks (eg: **My Text**) means text in bold. Please try to keep it."
