  },
  "guide_open_beauty_facts_what_is_open_beauty_facts_title": "什麼是「開放美容真相」？",
  "guide_open_beauty_facts_what_is_open_beauty_facts_paragraph1": "Open Beauty Facts 是一個化妝品產品協作資料庫。",
  "@guide_open_beauty_facts_what_is_open_beauty_facts_paragraph1": {
    "description": "Text between asterisks (eg: **My Text**) means text in bold. Please try to keep it."
  },
  "guide_open_beauty_facts_what_is_open_beauty_facts_paragraph2": "Our goal is to decipher ingredient lists to help you **understand what's in your personal care items**. From moisturisers to makeup, we collect data on ingredients, allergens, and packaging to promote transparency in the cosmetics industry.",
  "@guide_open_beauty_facts_what_is_open_beauty_facts_paragraph2": {
    "description": "Text between asterisks (eg: **My Text**) means text in bold. Please try to keep it."
  },
  "guide_open_beauty_facts_features_title": "開放美容事實的特點",
  "guide_open_beauty_facts_features_arg1_title": "獲得您不需要的成分的提醒",
  "guide_open_beauty_facts_features_arg1_paragraph1": "您對某些成分過敏嗎？想避免使用致粉刺成分嗎？想避開有爭議的食材嗎？您可以在應用程式中設定一份要避免的化妝品成分清單！",
  "guide_open_beauty_facts_tips_title": "拍攝精彩照片的技巧",
  "guide_open_beauty_facts_tips_arg1_title": "禁忌",
