  "guide_open_prices_title": "歡迎來到公開價格！",
  "@guide_open_prices_title": {
    "description": "The title of the guide (please don't forget the use of non-breaking spaces)"
  },
  "guide_open_prices_what_is_open_prices_title": "什麼是公開價格？",
  "guide_open_prices_what_is_open_prices_paragraph1": "Open Prices 是一個旨在收集和分享全球產品價格的專案。它是一個公開可用的資料集，可用於研究、分析等用途。 Open Prices 由 Open Food Facts 開發和維護。",
  "@guide_open_prices_what_is_open_prices_paragraph1": {
    "description": "Text between asterisks (eg: **My Text**) means text in bold. Please try to keep it."
  },
  "guide_open_prices_what_is_open_prices_paragraph2": "There are currently few companies that own large databases of product prices at the barcode level. These prices are not freely available, but sold at a high price to private actors, researchers and other organisations that can afford them.",
  "@guide_open_prices_what_is_open_prices_paragraph2": {
    "description": "Text between asterisks (eg: **My Text**) means text in bold. Please try to keep it."
  },
  "guide_open_prices_how_title": "公開價格是如何運作的？",
  "guide_open_prices_how_paragraph1": "我們正在眾包一個開源的價格資料集。使用者可以透過此網頁應用程式或官方的 Open Food Facts 行動應用程式添加價格資訊。零售商或第三方應用程式也可以透過我們的 API 貢獻數據。",
  "guide_open_prices_how_arg1_title": "收集過道中的價格標籤照片",
  "guide_open_prices_how_arg2_title": "收集收據照片。",
  "guide_open_prices_why_title": "Open Food Facts為什麼要這樣做？",
  "guide_open_prices_why_paragraph1": "價格資訊對於理解食品體系至關重要。它是了解食品成本和促進健康飲食的關鍵因素。公開價格數據能夠幫助研究人員、記者和公眾更輕鬆地了解食品價格在不同地區和時間上的變化。",
  "guide_open_prices_why_arg1_title": "追蹤價格隨時間的變化",
  "guide_open_prices_why_arg1_text": "看看價格的**演變**：縮水式通膨、廉價式通膨，我們可以一起追蹤它們！",
  "guide_open_prices_why_arg2_title": "比較您附近的商品價格",
  "guide_open_prices_why_arg2_text": "隨著我們掌握更多價格信息，您可以找到**您附近最便宜的商店**。",
  "guide_open_prices_scrapping_title": "你有沒有考慮過從零售商網站上抓取價格資訊？",
  "guide_open_prices_scrapping_paragraph1": "基於法律和技術原因，**我們不認為從零售商網站抓取價格是向 Open Prices 貢獻價格的有效方式**。我們希望確保收集到的價格準確且最新，而接收貢獻者抓取的價格資訊會讓我們無法做到這一點。",
  "guide_open_prices_scrapping_paragraph2": "價格抓取是 Open Prices 未來版本中的一個考慮選項，但它將由 Open Prices 本身完成，以便我們能夠根據 HTML 頁面獲得價格證明。",
  "guide_open_prices_retailers_title": "我是零售商，想要提供價格。我該怎麼做？",
  "guide_open_prices_retailers_paragraph1": "您可以使用我們的 API 貢獻價格資訊。\n如果您想大規模貢獻價格信息，請透過 prices@openfoodfacts.org 與我們聯繫。",
  "guide_open_prices_share_link": "https://prices.openfoodfacts.org/about",
  "guide_open_products_facts_title": "歡迎來到開放產品資訊！",
  "@guide_open_products_facts_title": {
    "description": "The title of the guide (please don't forget the use of non-breaking spaces)"
  },
  "guide_open_products_facts_what_is_open_products_facts_title": "什麼是開放產品資訊？",
  "guide_open_products_facts_what_is_open_products_facts_paragraph1": "Open Products Facts 是一個龐大的開放資料庫，其中包含**任何帶有條碼的產品，但不包括食品、化妝品或寵物食品**。",
  "@guide_open_products_facts_what_is_open_products_facts_paragraph1": {
    "description": "Text between asterisks (eg: **My Text**) means text in bold. Please try to keep it."
  },
  "guide_open_products_facts_what_is_open_products_facts_paragraph2": "從電子產品到玩具，從服裝到清潔用品，只要有條碼，都可以添加進去。本專案旨在為日常物品建立“物聯網”，使所有相關資訊都能被普遍取得。",
  "@guide_open_products_facts_what_is_open_products_facts_paragraph2": {
    "description": "Text between asterisks (eg: **My Text**) means text in bold. Please try to keep it."
  },
  "guide_open_products_facts_features_title": "開放產品事實的特點",
  "guide_open_products_facts_features_text": "Open Products Facts 旨在透過提供循環解決方案，幫助消費者**延長物品的使用壽命**，從而維護、**修理**、**回收**物品或將其轉贈給新的主人。",
  "guide_open_products_facts_features_arg1_title": "某些產品的碳足跡",
  "guide_open_products_facts_features_arg1_text": "**Impact CO2** by French Environment Authority ADEME provides the **carbon impact** of many categories, make sure to categorise products precisely.",
  "guide_open_products_facts_features_arg2_title": "許多產品的可修復性指數",
  "guide_open_products_facts_features_arg2_text": "只要有法國可修復性指數，我們就會顯示出來。此外，**您可以使用民間分類引擎開始收集相關變數**；這樣，即使在沒有該指數的國家/地區，我們也可以在將來自行重新計算該指數。",
  "guide_open_products_facts_features_arg3_title": "尋找捐贈/轉售產品的方法",
  "guide_open_products_facts_features_arg3_text": "我們提供指向**第三方循環經濟友好型服務**的鏈接，幫助您以二手商品的形式找到心儀的產品，從而更加環保地利用地球資源。\n請注意，我們並未因此獲得報酬，且該系統目前僅作為法國兩家網站的範例。您可以透過在維基上記錄更多網站來幫助擴展該系統。",
  "guide_open_products_facts_information_title": "哪些資訊有用？",
  "guide_open_products_facts_information_text": "針對如此廣泛的物品，**我們收集的數據具有靈活性**。為此，**我們創建了民間分類引擎**。",
  "guide_open_products_facts_folksonomy_title": "民間分類引擎",
  "guide_open_products_facts_folksonomy_paragraph1": "民間分類引擎是一款幫助您完善產品相關屬性的工具。這不僅有助於提升搜尋和發現率，還能在未來計算並展示更多有趣的內容。",
  "guide_open_products_facts_folksonomy_paragraph2": "您可以新增任何按鍵和值，例如：**compatibility_with_5G_mobile_network: yes**",
  "guide_open_products_facts_folksonomy_paragraph3": "系統會自動提供可能的屬性建議，我們也非常歡迎您新增和記錄您喜歡的產品類型的新屬性。",
  "guide_open_products_facts_share_link": "https://world-en.openproductsfacts.org/discover",
